OL,3,AMexican drug lord on FBI's 10 most
OL,4,Awanted list arrested in shoot-out
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeza Flores was wanted in Mexico on
OL,7,Forganised crime charges, while he has
OL,8,Fbeen accused of "flooding the US with
OL,9,Ffentanyl, cocaine, heroin and other
OL,10,Fdeadly drugs" by the FBI. The US is
OL,11,Fseeking his extradition.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
